' ============================================================================
' FLUJO 17: HIPÓTESIS HITL (Human In The Loop)
' ============================================================================

== F17: Revisión Humana de Hipótesis (HITL) ==

User -> Pages: Hypothesis Panel
Pages -> APIClient: listHypothesisCandidates(projectId)
APIClient -> FastAPI: GET /api/v1/hypotheses/candidates?proyecto_id=...
FastAPI -> Routers: \n(backend/app/api/v1/hypotheses.py)
Routers -> DB: SELECT hypotheses WHERE status='candidate'\n(backend/app/models/domain/synthesis.py → Hypothesis)
Routers --> APIClient: HypothesisCandidate[]

alt Accept
    User -> Pages: Aceptar hipótesis
    Pages -> APIClient: acceptHypothesis(id)
    Routers -> DB: UPDATE hypotheses SET status='accepted', confidence=1.0

else Modify
    User -> Pages: Modificar texto/nivel
    Pages -> APIClient: modifyHypothesis(id, {new_text, new_level})
    Routers -> DB: UPDATE hypotheses SET text, level, status='candidate'

else Reject
    User -> Pages: Rechazar hipótesis
    Pages -> APIClient: rejectHypothesis(id, {reason})
    Routers -> DB: UPDATE hypotheses SET status='rejected', confidence=0.0

else Split (Tree of Thoughts)
    User -> Pages: Dividir en sub-hipótesis
    Pages -> APIClient: splitHypothesis(id, {children: [...]})
    Routers -> DB: UPDATE parent → 'split'\nINSERT INTO hypotheses (hijas con parent_hypothesis_id)
end

